字节跳动-7671261513043085621.description:
1、明确行业的长期愿景与战略路径，把握整体方向，主导跨职能重点项目；全权负责行业的GMV增长和P&L，推动营收增长与盈利能力提升；
2、充分发挥行业经验与人脉资源，驱动行业增长与业务成功；搭建并带领高绩效团队，负责招聘、培养与辅导核心人才；
3、识别、筛选并引入新商家，积极推动TikTok Shop行业生态建设；端到端推进商家发展，管理战略合作关系并持续优化商家经营表现；
4、与运营、产品、市场营销等内部团队协作，释放商家潜力，加速直播电商与短视频带货的落地与普及；
5、在快速变化的环境中高效运作，有效应对不确定性、适应变化，并通过影响关键利益相关方推动战略决策落地；
6、拆解复杂问题，探索创新方案，推动可规模化解决方案落地，实现长期业务成功。

1.Define the long-term vision and strategic roadmap for your industry, setting direction and leading key cross-functional initiatives; Own the full P&L and GMV responsibility for your industry, driving both topline and profitability;
2.Leverage industry knowledge and your professional network to fuel industry  growth and success; Build and lead a high-performing team—hiring, developing, and coaching top talent;
3.Identify, prioritize, and onboard new sellers, actively shaping the industry's ecosystem on TikTok Shop; Drive end-to-end seller development by managing strategic relationships and optimizing their performance;
4.Collaborate with internal teams—including operations, product, and marketing—to to unlock seller potential and accelerate adoption of livestream and short video commerce;
5.Operate effectively in a dynamic environment, navigating ambiguity, adapting to change, and influencing key stakeholders to enable strategic decisions;
6.Break down complex problems, identify innovative approaches, and implement scalable solutions to drive long-term success.

