3、具备管理多元化团队的经验；
4、能够在模糊环境中灵活应对、快速适应变化。

1.Proven experience leading and scaling high-performing teams;
2.Strong strategic mindset with the ability to execute with precision and operational excellence; Demonstrated ability to use data-driven insights to inform decisions and optimize performance;
3.Extensive experience in industry management with a track record of delivering ambitious results;
4.Deep understanding of the Spanish market, including consumer behavior, digital trends, and mobile commerce transformation;
5.Growth-oriented, entrepreneurial mindset with excellent communication and stakeholder management skills;
6.Fluent in both Spanish and English, ensuring seamless communication with local partners and stakeholders.

Preferred qualifications:
1.Strong understanding of  E-commerce, content marketing and influencers;
2.Experience of owning P&L on an E-commerce platform/marketplace;
3.Experience in managing diverse teams;
4.Ability to thrive in ambiguity and adjust quickly to change.

